    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "With this skill, Claude can caption an existing video of one person talking: it transcribes locally, finds the subject, and composites captions without altering the footage. Options: quiet lower-third rail, cinematic embeds behind the person, themed VFX captions.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when the user requests captions for an existing single-speaker video — verbatim, cinematic, VFX, or catalog style. Single-shot only; clips without clear speech/face or with burned-in captions are refused.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Add lower-third verbatim captions to this video using the default anchor style.",
        "note": "Claude confirms the clip and identity first, then renders."
      },
      {
        "text": "Make this fully cinematic — embed every caption behind the speaker, no lower-third.",
        "note": "Routes to Cinematic mode; every word composites behind the person."
      },
      {
        "text": "Use the ordnance theme for a 'boom' VFX caption on this clip.",
